>  "lo TAG sumti" means nothing more or less like any other sumti, "X
> du lo broda" -> "X broda"  "X du lo TAG broda" -> "X TAG broda"  The
> tag (selbri tcita) comes along ("tags along" :-) with the selbri.  So
